{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はMJの収録に参加しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4thは全員で\n表題を披露させていただけるので\nんー嬉しい(´;ω;`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オンエアぜひ見てみてね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてMJの司会であるPerfumeさんに\n乃木坂46としてご挨拶しましたー(´;ω;`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同じアクターの先輩として\nちっちゃい頃からずっとずーっと\n尊敬していたPerfumeさん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スクール生の時にちらっと\nお会いしたことはあったのですが\n乃木坂入ってからは昨日が初めてで\nほんとにほんとに嬉しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どーんきらきらきらー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/1761465/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この髪型すっきー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもね制服の衣装を着てる時は\nさらさらストレートが評判なの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度こんな感じの雰囲気で\n旦那さまとデートするの(*/ω＼*)にゃひ\nこんちにーばかつきぃー///"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は学校のお昼休みにね\nひめたんはカイロのアプリを\n振りまくってあっためまくって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"友達はなんか怖ーい感じのアプリで\n怖ーいことしてましたー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あたしら平和だねーって(*^ω^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/1761465/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/1761465/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日芽香さんのお父さん（...まさかとは思いますが、ご健在ですよね？）、おいくつですか？\nぱぱは元気よご健在ですよーっ\nぱぱは3ちゃいらしいです(｀・ω・´)\nぱぱに聞いてみー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/1761465/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"染めてみたい髪の色は？\nおばあちゃんになったら紫にしたい！\n紫の髪のおばあたま、素敵でしょ(*^^*)？\nぴんくもかわういんだけどなー。んー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/1761465/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近元気出ないんですよ...ひめたんの元気のみなもとはなんですか？\nあなたが元気ならひめたも元気。\nだから心配するよーどしたのー(´;ω;`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/1761465/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中元さんの賢さを問う。次の式を展開せよ (x-a)(x-b)(x-c)・・・(x-z)\n0。\nもー全部紙に書いて悩んだのにー(∀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/1761465/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あなたは設楽派？日村派？笑\nうぬううう..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/1761465/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"背の低い男はどう思う？\n背は関係なーい(´・ω・｀)よ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/1761465/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/1761465/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(＊´・ω・＊)ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"}